From ddb00c9c0c8c5271a8ca4187df1d84c583a8f5e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@localhost>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 23:14:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] perf(merge_insert): evaluate source-first joins under a
 bounded pool

Experimental candidate for #9505; not ready for submission. Preserve DataFusion join optimization and parallelism. The wide-column counterexample still OOM-kills, so retain this commit for comparison rather than claim a complete fix.
---
 rust/lance/src/dataset/write/merge_insert.rs | 187 +++++++++++--------
 1 file changed, 108 insertions(+), 79 deletions(-)

diff --git a/rust/lance/src/dataset/write/merge_insert.rs b/rust/lance/src/dataset/write/merge_insert.rs
index f7fb280..8cc7ea4 100644
