+        RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([key@1], ...), input_partitions=1
           ProjectionExec: expr=[value@0 as value, key@1 as key, true as __merge_source_sentinel]
-            StreamingTableExec: partition_sizes=1, projection=[value, key]"
